data/catalogs/bitdefender/criteria.toml, generated by
scripts/engine/sync_bitdefender_criteria.py, lists the criteria of Bitdefender
GravityZone Basic detection and exclusion rules. They are facts (target and
field API names, Control Center field labels, the sensors that evaluate each
field and value, relations, value kinds, enumerated values, ranges and the
pairing rules) read from Bitdefender's "Detection and exclusion criteria for
Basic rules",
https://www.bitdefender.com/business/support/en/77209-1486297-detection-and-exclusion-criteria.html
(Copyright Bitdefender, all rights reserved). No sentence of it is copied: the
pairing rules are rewritten as data, and every description in the engine is
written for this repository. The fetch date is in the catalogue's header.
